# the tape as a looper: BARS on AUTO, an empty part, the first take's length set by REC (to the nearest bar line);
# then a fixed BARS; SEQ's BARS is the part's (all tracks); ARP baked into the part's bars
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
expect nev 0
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
wait 50
tap REC
wait 3200
expect recording 1
key w4 down 100
wait 300
key w4 up
wait 1500
key w6 down 100
wait 300
key w6 up
wait 4500
shot looper_auto.png
tap REC
wait 200
expect bars 2
expect playing 1
expect recording 0
expect events >1
tap PLAY
wait 100
# BARS fixed at 1 on the tape: a take loops at one bar
turn K1 -1
wait 50
expect bars 1
shot looper_fixed.png
# SEQ's BARS sets the part
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
wait 50
turn K2 3
wait 50
expect bars 4
expect textfit 0
